# Load / save game on the procedural UI system (pushed by the main menu's Load Game and by the in-game menu). Title
# top-left, the games list in one panel, Back at the left of the bottom bar, Delete / Save / Load at the right. The four
# confirmation boxes (load, overwrite, save description, delete) are hidden children shown by code: each is a dialog of
# its own. Units: 1 = frame height / 1080.
hide $SaveLoadParent
window $SaveLoadMenu left top 0 0 1920 1080
hide $SaveLoadMenu
window $MenuButtonFrame left top 0 0 1920 1080
hide $MenuButtonFrame
hide $line

window text:GUI:SelectAGame left top 64 40 560 48 title
ruler left top 64 94 560

panel left top 64 124 1792 832
window $ListboxGames left top 84 150 1752 780 list

window $ButtonBack left bottom 64 40 180 44 button
window $ButtonDelete right bottom 512 40 200 44 danger
window $ButtonSave right bottom 288 40 200 44 button
window $ButtonLoad right bottom 64 40 200 44 primary

include SaveLoadConfirms.layout
